# Firmware stand-ins for the saleae-logic-pro model (emu/src/models/saleae-logic-pro.rs):
# the FPGA bitstream the driver uploads in chunks of 1020 bytes. The
# size is the model's (a unit test checks it), not the vendor file's;
# it leaves a short last chunk (820 bytes). The FX3 firmware is a
# container of parts that the driver parses, which a plain stand-in is
# not: tools/emu/saleae-logic-pro.sh writes it.
saleae-logicpro16-fpga.bitstream 10000
